SUMMARY: Serendipity Lunch - The Creative Exchange
LOCATION:The Terrace
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $80.00 per person\nAvailability:
  5 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.
 com/events/191169\n\nContinuing the "Curated Connections" extension of the
  Serendipity series\, join us for lunch convening members who are involved
  in—or inspired by—the performing arts. From actors\, musicians\, danc
 ers\, directors\, and producers to passionate patrons and enthusiasts\, th
 is month's commonality will spark engaging conversation through a curated 
 deck of prompts facilitated by our Membership team.\n\nCurious? Set agains
 t the backdrop of lunch in Lunasol\, members will enjoy meaningful connect
 ions and lively discussion around creativity\, performance\, storytelling\
 , and the cultural impact of the arts. Whether you're center stage or in t
 he audience\, you'll leave with new perspectives\, new connections\, and a
  deeper appreciation for the vibrant performing arts community within The 
 'Quin—all while enjoying a thoughtful lunch prepared by the chef.\n\n*Ti
 ckets are $80 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. C
 ancellations within 48 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will be
  charged in full. Please inform us of any dietary needs or restrictions by
  emailing happening@thequin.com at least 72 hours prior to the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/191169
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
