UID:quin-event-194588@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260721T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T213000
SUMMARY:Private Screening: "The Odyssey" 
LOCATION:Offsite: Alamo Drafthouse Seaport
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: You are Con
 firmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/194588\n\n6:00P
 M Doors Open\, 6:30PM - 9:30PM Screening\nJoin us for a ‘Quin-exclusive 
 private screening of Christopher Nolan’s highly anticipated adaptation o
 f The Odyssey.\n\nA sweeping mythological epic inspired by Homer's timeles
 s poem\, The Odyssey stars Matt Damon as Odysseus\, the legendary King of 
 Ithaca. The film chronicles his perilous decade-long journey home followin
 g the Trojan War\, where he encounters mythical creatures\, vengeful gods\
 , and extraordinary trials in his relentless quest to reunite with his wif
 e\, Penelope. An evening of epic storytelling awaits...\n\n*This event is 
 complimentary and reserved for members\, plus one registered guest. Tables
 ide food and beverage service is available in the theater.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/194588
